## Live image with a lean Hyprland (Wayland) desktop + KaliAI agent tooling
##
## Built via: distro/build.sh --variant kaliai
##
## Package availability confirmed against pkg.kali.org for hyprland (0.56.2),
## hypridle (0.1.8), hyprlock (0.9.6) in kali-rolling as of 2026-09. The rest
## of this list has NOT been build-tested — verify with `apt-cache policy`
## in a real Kali chroot/VM before a production build.

## Live images always want these
kali-linux-core
kali-desktop-live

## Graphical desktop — Hyprland (Wayland compositor). No kali-desktop-hyprland
## metapackage exists upstream (unlike xfce/gnome/kde/i3/...), so the stack
## is listed explicitly instead of pulling in one meta-package.
hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
waybar
wofi
hypridle
hyprlock
lxqt-policykit
swaybg
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
cliphist
mako-notifier
libnotify-bin
kitty
sddm
pipewire
wireplumber
pipewire-pulse
bluez
network-manager

## Fonts — a Nerd Font is fetched directly from upstream by
## hooks/live/0030-fonts.chroot (see that file for why); these are just its
## build-time dependencies.
curl
unzip
fontconfig

## kaliai-hypr-toggle (gaps/opacity toggles) parses `hyprctl -j` output.
jq

## Metapackages
##   You can customize the set of Kali metapackages (groups of tools) to install
##   For the complete list see: https://www.kali.org/tools/kali-meta/
kali-linux-default

## KaliAI runtime deps — the kaliai CLI itself is installed by
## variant-kaliai/hooks/live/0020-kaliai-tooling.chroot, not apt.
python3-venv
python3-pip
rsync

## Extra Kali packages/tools/applications
##   For the complete list see: https://www.kali.org/tools/
##                              https://pkg.kali.org/
#<package>
